0..78 Comment "// A record type\'s faces refused: one face holds a label the record lacks, and"
79..159 Comment "// one face is named twice. A static bracket refused: it names a field or a face"
160..234 Comment "// that the record type lacks. Another bracket fixes a field at a value of"
235..310 Comment "// another type. A record literal at a patched type states a fixed field at"
311..388 Comment "// another value, and so does a configuration coerced in to a patched type. A"
389..465 Comment "// system of faces names one face twice, and another system\'s faces disagree"
466..485 Comment "// where they meet."
486..488 Comment "//"
489..568 Comment "// A face lists only labels its record holds, and each face has its own name. A"
569..648 Comment "// static bracket fixes only the fields its record type writes, and a face only"
649..723 Comment "// when the type member names it. Each refusal stands at the label, at the"
724..803 Comment "// second name or at the face, by its name. A fixed value has its field\'s type,"
804..877 Comment "// and the refusal stands at the value. A fixed field holds the value the"
878..953 Comment "// bracket fixes, and the refusal stands at the field or the configuration."
954..956 Comment "//"
957..1033 Comment "// The types stand in a module, whose members carry the verdict each refusal"
1034..1108 Comment "// states. Each refusal names the face and the record type. Two faces of a"
1109..1189 Comment "// system agree on their meet, and the refusal stands at the later face\'s value."
1190..1192 Comment "//"
1193..1275 Comment "// - see: `model/desc/record-faces.gandr` — the faces read, and the bracket read"
1276..1357 Comment "// - see: `pathological/desc/shaped-signature.gandr` — a theory\'s faces refused"
1358..1368 Comment "//   alike"
